{
  "name": "ENP - Weekly Intelligence Report",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ Setup — Credenciais e Configuração\n\n**1. Credencial Supabase (HTTP Request)**\nEm N8N → Credentials, crie uma credencial do tipo *Header Auth*:\n- Nome: `ENP Internal Secret`\n- Header Name: `x-internal-secret`\n- Header Value: valor de `SELECT value FROM app_configs WHERE key = 'internal_function_secret'`\n\n**2. Credencial Telegram**\nCrie uma credencial do tipo *Telegram API* (nativa do N8N):\n- Bot Token: token do BotFather\n\nNos nós Telegram, substitua `TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID` pelo ID do seu chat/canal/grupo.\n\n**3. Credenciais Supabase REST** (para o nó *Buscar Relatório*)\nCrie duas credenciais *Header Auth* adicionais:\n- `ENP Supabase Anon`: Header=`apikey`, Value=`<anon_key>`\n- `ENP Supabase Service Role`: Header=`Authorization`, Value=`Bearer <service_role_key>`\n\n**4. Agendamento**\nEste workflow roda toda **segunda-feira às 09:00 UTC (06:00 BRT)**.\nSe o pg_cron já está configurado, desative um dos dois para evitar duplicação:\n```\nSELECT cron.unschedule('generate-weekly-intelligence-report');\n```\n\n**5. Teste manual**\nUse o botão *Test Workflow* no N8N para disparar sem esperar a segunda-feira.",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "e1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "⚙️ Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 20]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 9 * * 1"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "e1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Segunda-feira 09h UTC",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [240, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-period-days",
              "name": "period_days",
              "value": 7,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [460, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://seqgnxynrcylxsdzbloa.supabase.co/functions/v1/generate-weekly-report",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-internal-secret",
              "value": "={{ $credentials.internalSecret }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"period_days\": {{ $json.period_days }},\n  \"generation_method\": \"scheduled\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 90000
        }
      },
      "id": "e1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Gerar Relatório",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [680, 500],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "enp-internal-secret",
          "name": "ENP Internal Secret"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-status-completed",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "completed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Geração OK?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [900, 500]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://seqgnxynrcylxsdzbloa.supabase.co/rest/v1/weekly_intelligence_reports?id=eq.{{ $('Gerar Relatório').item.json.report_id }}&select=period_start,period_end,ai_analysis,raw_metrics,tokens_used,duration_ms,cost_usd",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{ $credentials.supabaseAnonKey }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $credentials.supabaseServiceRoleKey }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Buscar Relatório",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1120, 380],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "enp-supabase-anon",
          "name": "ENP Supabase Anon"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const arr = $input.item.json;\nconst report = Array.isArray(arr) ? arr[0] : arr;\nif (!report) throw new Error('Relatório não encontrado no banco');\n\nconst ai = report.ai_analysis || {};\nconst metrics = report.raw_metrics || {};\n\nconst fmtDate = (ds) => new Date(ds + 'T12:00:00Z').toLocaleDateString('pt-BR', { day: '2-digit', month: '2-digit', year: 'numeric' });\nconst period = fmtDate(report.period_start) + ' – ' + fmtDate(report.period_end);\n\nlet bullets = [];\nif (typeof ai.executive_summary === 'string') {\n  bullets = ai.executive_summary.split('\\n').filter(Boolean).slice(0, 5);\n} else if (Array.isArray(ai.executive_summary)) {\n  bullets = ai.executive_summary.slice(0, 5).map(String);\n}\nconst summaryText = bullets.length\n  ? bullets.map(b => '• ' + b.trim().replace(/^[•\\-\\*]\\s*/, '')).join('\\n')\n  : '(sem resumo disponível)';\n\nconst hotLeads = (metrics.hot_leads_without_followup || []).length;\nconst pipeline = metrics.leads_pipeline || {};\nconst tw = pipeline.this_week;\nconst newLeads = (tw != null && typeof tw === 'object') ? (tw.total ?? tw.count ?? '?') : (tw ?? '?');\nconst bookings = (metrics.booking_activity || {}).this_week ?? '?';\nconst revRaw = (metrics.subscription_revenue || {}).revenue_this_week_brl;\nconst revenue = revRaw != null\n  ? 'R$ ' + Number(revRaw).toLocaleString('pt-BR', { minimumFractionDigits: 0 })\n  : '—';\n\nconst alertsList = Array.isArray(ai.alerts) ? ai.alerts : [];\nconst criticals = alertsList.filter(a => a.severity === 'critical');\nconst critLabel = criticals.length > 0 ? ' (' + criticals.length + ' crítico)' : '';\nconst alertsLabel = String(alertsList.length) + critLabel;\n\nconst costVal = report.cost_usd ? '$' + Number(report.cost_usd).toFixed(4) : '—';\nconst durVal = report.duration_ms ? Math.round(report.duration_ms / 1000) + 's' : '—';\n\nconst message = [\n  '📊 *Relatório Semanal de Inteligência*',\n  '📅 ' + period,\n  '',\n  '*Resumo Executivo*',\n  summaryText,\n  '',\n  '📈 *Métricas da Semana*',\n  '👥 Leads Novos: *' + newLeads + '*',\n  '🔥 Leads Quentes sem Follow\\-up: *' + hotLeads + '*',\n  '📅 Agendamentos: *' + bookings + '*',\n  '💰 Receita: *' + revenue + '*',\n  '⚠️ Alertas: *' + alertsLabel + '*',\n  '',\n  '⏱️ Gerado em ' + durVal + ' \\| Custo: ' + costVal,\n  '',\n  '🔗 [Ver Relatório Completo](https://hub.euanapratica.com/admin/inteligencia\\-semanal)'\n].join('\\n');\n\nreturn [{ json: { message, alerts: alertsList, criticals, period } }];"
      },
      "id": "e1b2c3d4-0001-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Formatar Mensagem",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1340, 380]
